Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Умеуме
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Хехе...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,мен және
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Сыпайылықтың мақтанышы
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Менде бар.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Егер
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Қаласаңыз.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Менің еш күмәнім жоқ.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,.
