Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Архат
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Иә?
