Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Моноклдың сынған дыбысы
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Я...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ха...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《Солған кезде де әдемі гүлдер》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ха...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《Ол нәрсе
