Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Уф
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Я...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,.
